{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"I found the core defect: the API mapper assigns `visible` into the persistence field `available`, while the core product has no persisted visibility field at all. I’m correcting that mapping, adding shopper-only visibility filtering, and enforcing visibility during cart addition and checkout."}}
