{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"The main behavior is now wired: persisted `VISIBLE` is independent from `AVAILABLE`; public product reads/lists and cart adds reject hidden products, while `/api/v1/private/products` uses the merchant origin and remains protected by the existing `/private/**` security rule. I’m compiling now to catch integration issues, especially checkout exception flow."}}
